Title OSRDNMesaAccel
Version 1.0
Description Intel i486-only ATI Radeon 9250 hardware acceleration for the OPENSTEP Mesa 3.4.2 port. Adds libGL_radeon.a BESIDE the stock Mesa libraries rather than replacing them: Mesa itself is untouched, and a program chooses acceleration when it is built by linking this archive. Requires OSRDNDisplay installed and active. Includes the present header SDL2 programs register (OSRDNMesaPresent.h). It does NOT include the demos -- they are in OpenStepMesa342DemosRDN. Contains Mesa code; Mesa's own notices are in Documentation/OpenStep-Radeon9250-Accel/Mesa-3.4.2.
DefaultLocation /LocalDeveloper
Relocatable YES
Application NO
UseUserMask NO
DiskName OPENSTEP Radeon 9250 Mesa Accel Intel
DeleteWarning Removing this package removes only the accelerated library, its headers and its documentation from the selected development prefix. The stock Mesa libraries, their documentation, the demos and the display driver are untouched.
